Large Anime Text Dataset
========================

Developer & maintainer: Muhammad Muqeet
Contact: contact@animearray.site, muqeet@animearray.site, muqeet@anitroves.com

This product/package contains aggregated data sourced from the following
providers. Underlying source content remains subject to each provider's terms
as recorded in exports/sources.jsonl, exports/attribution.json and
exports/provenance.jsonl.

  - AniList           (https://anilist.co)            — terms: https://anilist.co/terms
  - Kitsu             (https://kitsu.io)              — terms: https://kitsu.io/terms
  - Shikimori         (https://shikimori.io)          — terms: https://shikimori.io/terms
  - Wikidata          (https://wikidata.org)          — CC0-1.0
  - Anime News
    Network           (https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/encyclopedia/)
  - MyAnimeList       (https://myanimelist.net)       — not collected

